      "note": "+2 damage with melee weapon attacks. SRD: applies only when wielding in one hand with no other weapons — engine cannot check weapon-hold state, applies unconditionally to all melee attacks. Fixed: was a stat-modifier (damage.bonus.melee) that was never evaluated."
    }
  },
